---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import AashaCare from '../../components/AashaCare.astro';
import { entries, entryPath, readingStats } from '../../data/neurodevelopment';
const canonical = 'https://mindgracencr.in/aasha/learning';
const headExtra = `<title>Autism and ADHD Learning Hub | Aasha Greater Noida</title><meta name="description" content="Explore sourced autism and ADHD guides, research explainers and printable family resources from the Aasha learning library in Greater Noida."><link rel="canonical" href="${canonical}"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/min/seo-pages.min.css">`;
const schema = JSON.stringify({ '@context': 'https://schema.org', '@graph': [
  { '@type': 'CollectionPage', name: 'Autism and ADHD learning hub', url: canonical, mainEntity: { '@type': 'ItemList', itemListElement: entries.map((entry, i) => ({ '@type': 'ListItem', position: i + 1, name: entry.title, url: `https://mindgracencr.in${entryPath(entry)}` })) } },
  { '@type': 'BreadcrumbList', itemListElement: [{ '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: 'https://mindgracencr.in/' }, { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Aasha', item: 'https://mindgracencr.in/aasha' }, { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 3, name: 'Learning hub', item: canonical }] }
] });
---
<Layout headExtra={headExtra}>
<main id="main-content" class="seo-page">
<nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb" data-authored-breadcrumbs><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/aasha">Aasha</a> / <span aria-current="page">Learning hub</span></nav>
<section class="seo-hero"><p class="seo-kicker">Aasha · Learn, prepare, participate</p><h1>Understanding autism and ADHD, one question at a time</h1><p class="seo-answer">Clear family guides to assessment, everyday support and the science behind treatment claims. Start with your question, then use a worksheet to prepare for a conversation with your child’s care team.</p><div class="seo-actions"><a class="btn" href="#guides">Explore the guides</a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="#resources">Print a planning sheet</a></div></section>
<section class="seo-section"><h2>Choose a starting point</h2><ul><li><strong>New concerns?</strong> Read about <a href="/blog/pages/child/autism-screening-and-assessment">screening and assessment</a>.</li><li><strong>Loss of skills?</strong> Read <a href="/blog/pages/child/developmental-regression">when to seek medical assessment</a>.</li><li><strong>Considering a treatment?</strong> Use the <a href="/blog/pages/child/autism-treatment-evidence">evidence questions</a>.</li><li><strong>Preparing for a visit?</strong> Try the <a href="/aasha/developmental-check-in">developmental check-in</a> or print a worksheet below.</li></ul></section>
{(['article', 'resource'] as const).map(kind => <section class="seo-section" id={kind === 'article' ? 'guides' : 'resources'}><h2>{kind === 'article' ? 'Guides and research explainers' : 'Printable family resources'}</h2><div class="seo-grid">{entries.filter(entry => entry.kind === kind).map(entry => <article class="seo-card learning-card">{kind === 'article' && <img src={`/assets/images/learning/${entry.image}.png`} alt="" width="1200" height="630" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />}<p class="seo-kicker">{kind === 'article' ? 'Read and understand' : 'Print and prepare'}</p><h3><a href={entryPath(entry)}>{entry.title}</a></h3><p>{entry.description}</p><p class="reading-duration">{readingStats(entry).readingMinutes} min read{kind === 'resource' ? ' · Printable worksheet included' : ' · Sources and comparison table'}</p>{kind === 'resource' && <a href={`${entryPath(entry)}#worksheet`}>Go straight to the worksheet</a>}</article>)}</div></section>)}
<section class="seo-section" id="editorial"><h2>How this collection was prepared</h2><p>Supplied exam notes and presentation transcripts were consolidated into original family guides. Claims were checked against the linked public guidance on 26 October 2026. Hypotheses, testimonials and dosing tables were not adopted as treatment recommendations.</p><p>No named clinician review has been recorded for this collection. The doctors named in the original notes are not credited as authors or endorsers. These pages provide general education, not an individual assessment or prescription.</p><p>International guidance is labelled by source; it does not establish Indian regulatory approval, local prevalence or entitlement to services. We avoid promises of cures and focus on comfort, communication and participation.</p></section>
<section class="seo-section"><h2>Connect learning with local care</h2><p>Aasha Early Intervention Centre supports child development in Gamma 2, Greater Noida. Explore <a href="/aasha/developmental-assessment">developmental assessment</a>, <a href="/aasha/speech-language-therapy">speech and language therapy</a> and <a href="/aasha/occupational-therapy">occupational therapy</a>, or <a href="/aasha/book">request an appointment</a>.</p><p>For more reading, visit the <a href="/blog/children">children’s blog</a>, <a href="/resources">resources directory</a> and <a href="/sleep-and-autism-guide-indian-parents">sleep and autism guide</a>.</p></section>
<AashaCare />
</main><script type="application/ld+json" set:html={schema}></script>
</Layout>

<style>.learning-card img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:1rem}.reading-duration{font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600}.learning-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column}.learning-card .reading-duration{margin-top:auto;padding-top:1rem}</style>
